{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24846","headline":"送春 · 杨衡","name":"送春","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"三月三十日，春归日复暮。\n惆怅问春风，明朝应不住。\n送春曲江上，眷眷东西顾。\n但见扑水花，纷纷不知数。\n人生似行客，两足无停步。\n日日进前程，前程几多路。\n兵刃与水火，尽可违之去。\n惟有老到来，人间无避处。\n感时良未已，独倚池南树。\n今日送春心，心如别亲故。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"杨衡","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24846.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24846","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}